# Engine exit 6 = PAIRING_EXPIRED during fetch: no launch of the empty stub and config.json
# is NEVER rewritten. PINS SHIPPED BEHAVIOR: this lane shows the generic failure panel —
# the missing rc=6 special-casing (NextUI has an actionable message + re-pair banner) is a
# reported finding, not silently "fixed" here.
desc fetch: rc=6 pairing expired -> no launch, config untouched (generic panel — shipped)
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi up
sdfile Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
engine 6|PAIRING_EXPIRED
expect_exit 0
expect_trace ENGINE --download
expect_file_empty Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_trace_absent STOCK
expect_config_has "token": "stub-token"
expect_config_has "device_name": "stub-device"
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Download failed'
